      "textEvidence": {
        "text": "This card has one continuous battle rule and no ignition effect, activation cost, target, or extra operation. If an opponent's monster is destroyed by battle with D.D. Crazy Beast, banish that monster instead of sending it to its owner's Graveyard. The rule works whether this card attacks or is attacked, including mutual battle destruction, while this card's face-up effect applies. It does not banish a monster that remains on the field, and it does not banish this card merely because this card loses a battle. Skill Drain negates the continuous effect. The actual owner's banished zone receives a monster controlled by the other player.",
        "format": "full-rule-paraphrase",
